			"Message": "chore(Element): Advance submodules to latest upstream revisions\n\nBatch update across Cocoon, Mountain, SideCar, and Wind submodules to synchronize with upstream.\n\nCocoon performs a routine regeneration cycle updating RouteManifest timestamp from 2026-06-04T21:15:38Z to 2026-06-05T09:01:15Z and rebuilding all compiled artifacts across bootstrap, effect, service, handler, gRPC, and dual-track layers.\n\nMountain completes the parking_lot migration for ApplicationState and command modules, replacing std::sync::Mutex and tokio::sync::RwLock with parking_lot equivalents across 20+ state modules (Debug, Decorations, Diagnostics, Documents, Keybindings, LifecyclePhase, Markers, NavigationHistory, OutputChannels, TreeViews, Webviews, WorkingCopy), removing poison-error boilerplate, and simplifying lock acquisition patterns. A follow-up formatting pass normalizes imports, condenses getter methods, standardizes lock patterns, and adds missing newlines across the state hierarchy and command handlers.\n\nSideCar adds missing trailing newlines to Cache.json in two commits for POSIX text file compliance.\n\nWind applies automated formatting to generated Effect-TS service interfaces and ESBuild configuration files, then regenerates all 200+ service interfaces from VS Code upstream sources with standardized whitespace and updates CommandCatalog with 6,600+ new command entries. ServiceCatalog version bumped to 2026-06-05.\n\nAll changes maintain API compatibility; no breaking changes.",
			"SHA": "e140cd0bd80ec78284d70c12c88405313074a478"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
