		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-05T07:40:56Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⡏⠀⠀",
				27,
				14
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Advance all submodules to latest upstream revisions\n\nBatch update across all Element submodules to synchronize with upstream.\n\nMountain introduces FileReadAlias consolidation into FileSystem with Matches method updates for alias handling, removes Clone derives from application state structs in favor of SharedApplicationState, adds SCMHandleCounter for source-control provider handle management, enhances ExtensionRegistry provider handle and command registry access, and resolves issues 64, 65, 67, 68 alongside mechanical formatting cleanup.\n\nCocoon updates @effect/platform-node to 0.107.0, protobufjs to 8.6.0, and Vitest to 4.1.8, normalizes ESBuild config formatting across all configuration files, and regenerates RouteManifest with Mountain RPC method count increased from 142 to 145 reflecting three new FileWatcher methods (Unwatch, Watch, WatchStatus).\n\nWind applies automated formatting pass across 200+ generated Effect-TS service interfaces and ESBuild configs for consistent whitespace and PascalCase conventions.\n\nSky upgrades Astro to 6.4.4 and Vite to 8.0.16 for the editor UI component layer.\n\nOutput expands architectural comments across the entire bundling pipeline documenting Electron→Tauri+Effect-TS transformation rationale for every exclusion, polyfill, and plugin transform.\n\nCommon and Echo update @cloudflare/workers-types to 4.20260605.1; Echo also bumps miniflare to 4.20260603.0 and wrangler to 4.98.0.\n\nRest and Worker receive mechanical whitespace formatting improvements. Air, Grove, Maintain, SideCar, and Vine advance with minor updates.\n\nAll changes maintain API compatibility; no breaking changes.",
			"SHA": "4ba68b2c884800bb004ba3be8099a5c85ef84a2b"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-04T21:31:46Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⠇⠀⠀",
				27,
				13
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Advance all submodules to latest upstream revisions\n\nBatch update across all Element submodules to synchronize with upstream.\n\nMountain introduces a stable workspace identifier based on configuration path or folder URI, completes the CreateEffectForRequest refactoring with Matches pre-filters and parameter borrowing to reduce clone overhead on the hot dispatch path, and fixes an ActiveOperations leak on RPC cancellation in addition to Vine filesystem corrections for WriteFile byte-array decoding and Stat empty-path ordering.\n\nWind fixes SCM duplicate registration by ensuring ResolveConfiguration excludes folderUri when workspace is present.\n\nCocoon regenerates RouteManifest to include FileWatcher.Unwatch, FileWatcher.Watch, and FileWatcher.WatchStatus methods and rebuilds compiled artifacts across bootstrap, effect, service, handler, gRPC, and dual-track layers.\n\nAll remaining submodules advance with minor formatting normalizations and CI dependency bumps.",
